    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Create audience, Display Mailchimp subscription form.</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to Mailchimp API, it&#8217;s needed to create your audience and add people who subscribe to that audience.</p>\n<p>This service is provided by &#8220;Intuit Mailchimp&#8221;: <a href=\"https://www.intuit.com/privacy/statement\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">terms of use</a>, <a href=\"https://mailchimp.com/legal/terms/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">privacy policy</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin file to your computer and unzip it</li>\n<li>Using an FTP program, or your hosting control panel, upload the unzipped plugin folder to your WordPress installation&#8217;s wp-content/plugins/ directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the Plugins menu within the WordPress admin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
